# THE SEALED COMPILER IS THIS REPOSITORY: `Compiler/` and `contrib/juliac/`,
# two directories up. `sealed_paths.sh` finds it, and `SEALED_JULIA` names
# another checkout. See HISTORY.md for the vendored and patch-replay layouts
# that came before.
#
# `env2/` is the generated project that names the compiler. `./sealed.sh setup`
# writes it, and it holds an absolute path, so it can not be tracked.
env2/
work*/
*.log
*.cov
